# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# molab training artifacts
#
# The notebook downloaded back from molab and the results archive it produces.
# The notebook of record is notebooks/train_satquery.py, which IS tracked; the
# .ipynb is a round-trip export of the same cells, and the zip is 374 MB of
# adapter weights that live in the private HF repo instead.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
satquery*.ipynb
satquery_full*.zip
satquery_numbers*.zip

# Shallow clone of the BigEarthNet.txt dataset repo, pulled for the parquet.
# Git-LFS objects inside it are over GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit.
